Parts of the Phantom AI Integration plugin (ai-integrations/) are adapted from Orca (https://github.com/stablyai/orca):
the remote pairing address classification (src/main/kotlin/dev/phantom/ai/remote/RemoteAddress.kt), the worktree
and branch naming (src/main/kotlin/dev/phantom/ai/sidebar/WorktreeCreator.kt), the text a file drop types into an
agent terminal (src/main/kotlin/dev/phantom/ai/terminal/TerminalDrop.kt), and the `codex app-server` usage probe
arguments and rate-limit window classification (src/main/kotlin/dev/phantom/ai/usage/CodexUsageClient.kt).
